# Prisma
packages/db/prisma/*.db

# Any local SQLite file. The Prisma provider is postgresql, so a dev.db anywhere in this
# tree is a broken leftover — but a 448K one sat in packages/db/prisma for four months
# looking like real state. Ignore them all, not just the one directory.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

